    "retargeting_caveat": "Exposure is logged over the same 2-week window as the outcome, and retargeting means site visits can cause ad eligibility. Compliers are partly selected on outcome behaviour (complier baseline E[Y(0)|C] vs control mean shows it), so the CACE is a ratio of ITTs for this population, not the effect of a pre-defined ad opportunity. Ghost-ads designs log the counterfactual first opportunity to avoid this.",
